# Project priors — Read-only

## Track
Personal vault written by an external pipeline (e.g., Monogram → markdown). Claude Code stays read-only here.

## Discipline
- DO NOT edit files in this repo via Claude Code.
- DO NOT commit. The owning pipeline owns commits.
- READ-ONLY operations are fine: search, summarize, extract context for other tasks.

## Why
The owning pipeline auto-commits this repo (Telegram → 5-stage LLM → markdown → git). Manual edits create merge conflicts and break the audit trail.

## Forbidden
- `Write`, `Edit`, `MultiEdit` on any file in this repo.
- `git commit`, `git push`, `gh pr create`.
- Running tests that mutate state.

## Allowed
- `Read`, `Glob`, `Grep` — read-only inspection.
- Quoting content into chat (with citation).
- Summarizing for context in other projects.

## Skill triggers
None. This repo is observation-only.
